# LodgeX AI

Read `docs/ai/README.md` and `docs/ai/AI_REPOSITORY_ASSESSMENT.md` before changing AI code.

- AI recommends. People approve. Do not assign rooms, publish schedules, write scorecard grades, send formal notices, or auto-execute high-impact ops.
- Official IDs only: CH-01–CH-11, SL-01–SL-11, MP-01–MP-09. No MP-10. No fourth product.
- Room Inventory Intelligence is SL-02 + SL-03 (class P). SL-01 is Lodge Executive Brief.
- Availability is a stay-night ledger. Vacant Clean is check-in fitness only, after inventory math.
- Training: `docs/ai/RESERVATION_AGENT_TRAINING.md` (enterprise standard v1.0, 20 Aug 2026).
- Use the capability resolver. Do not hard-code product dependencies.
- Proposed actions go through existing LodgeX services after human approval.
- Default `AI_MODE=shadow`. Never commit `XAI_API_KEY`.
- Do not calculate payroll. Scorecard grade = lowest component, Laravel only.
- Only a Lodge Manager may approve overtime (`OvertimeApprovalService`).
- Reuse approve/dismiss UX. Do not route room proposals through Room Utilization release approve.
- Minimize diffs. Do not rebuild camp-reservations.
